# Original look

The Horseradish site was first designed from Flow Digital’s pricing page: https://flow.digital/pricing

Borrow the light treatment: a pale ground, huge black type, and a few words set in solid color blocks. Flow Digital is a Brooklyn company (300 Kent Ave). It is not a British site.

Do not bring back their pricing tiers, session packages, or sales page. Horseradish dropped that. The reference is the look, not the product.
